Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:23.34,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}What'd I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.94,0:02:27.80,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}父母你没得选
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.94,0:02:27.80,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Well, you don't pick your parents,
