Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.51,0:02:35.19,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你知道吗? 以前人们会叫他收税人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.51,0:02:35.19,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You know, they used to call him The Tax Man for a while?
