Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.03,0:02:39.73,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}He'd come out of Texas, so nobody knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.69,0:02:41.76,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我觉得他...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.69,0:02:41.76,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Seemed a bit...
