Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.31,0:03:04.99,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Kind of a strange guy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.90,0:03:09.22,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.90,0:03:09.22,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:11.77,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:11.77,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah.
