Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.77,0:07:07.12,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}被平躺放置了一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.77,0:07:07.12,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}before he moved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.01,0:07:17.16,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}所以他们才叫他收税人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.01,0:07:17.16,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}That's why they called him The Tax Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.33,0:07:21.32,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们其他人不过是有个小本子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.33,0:07:21.32,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}The rest of us had these little note pads or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.51,0:07:24.05,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}而他则是有一大本记事薄
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.51,0:07:24.05,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}He had this big ledger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.05,0:07:28.26,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}像个收税人似的带着这本子到处走 很搞笑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.05,0:07:28.26,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Looked funny walking door to door with it like the tax man,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.89,0:07:32.05,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}从外号上来说到也不是太差
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.89,0:07:32.05,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}which ain't bad as far as nicknames go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.45,0:07:36.40,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}没错 我是会记很多笔记
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.45,0:07:36.40,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah. Of course I've always taken a lot of notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.30,0:07:40.12,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你永远也不知道会遇到什么事 不是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.30,0:07:40.12,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I mean, you never know what the thing's gonna be, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.97,0:07:43.80,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}也许本子上记的东西某一天
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.97,0:07:43.80,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}A little detail somewhere way down the line
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:48.42,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}会让你惊呼一声 破了案子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:48.42,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}makes you say, "Ohh!", breaks the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.18,0:07:51.57,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我见过很多种人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.18,0:07:51.57,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You know, I've seen all the different types.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.57,0:07:53.90,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们每个人都符合某个分类...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.57,0:07:53.90,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We all fit a certain category...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.96,0:08:02.36,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}恶霸 迷人精 代父
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.96,0:08:02.36,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}the bully, the charmer, the, uh, surrogate dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.36,0:08:07.76,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}狂怒之人 有脑子的...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.36,0:08:07.76,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}the man possessed by ungovernable rage, the brain...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.26,0:08:13.92,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}每一种都可能是个好警探
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.26,0:08:13.92,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and any of those types could be a good detective,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:17.61,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}也有可能是不称职的脑残货
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:17.61,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and any of those types could be an incompetent shitheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.86,0:08:20.09,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你是哪一种?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.86,0:08:20.09,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Which type were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.37,0:08:26.11,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我是最普通的那一种
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.37,0:08:26.11,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Oh, I was just a regular type dude
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:28.19,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}就是派头比较大
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:28.19,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}with a big-ass dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.40,0:08:34.39,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这些分类源于他们如何对待上级
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.40,0:08:34.39,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}A lot of it had to do with how they manage authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:42.02,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}对上级 对警惕心来说 也许是个负担
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:42.02,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}There can be a burden in authority, in vigilance,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.59,0:08:45.95,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}就像是父亲的负担
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.59,0:08:45.95,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}like a father's burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.64,0:08:48.38,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}有些人承受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.64,0:08:48.38,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It was too much for some men.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.37,0:08:52.76,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不为所动的聪明人很少
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.37,0:08:52.76,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}A smart guy who's steady is hard to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.34,0:08:56.10,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我还不错 比某些人强
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.34,0:08:56.10,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I was all right, better than some,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.10,0:09:01.03,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我知道怎么跟人交谈 我可以不为所动
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.10,0:09:01.03,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}but I knew how to talk to people, and I was steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:07.46,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}拉斯特 他原先在德克萨斯州的文件被密封了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:07.46,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Rust...now his Texas files were classified
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.46,0:09:11.46,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}或修改了 他不怎么喜欢说话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.46,0:09:11.46,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}or redacted, and he wasn't big on talking
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.32,0:09:14.88,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}但是你想让他闭嘴的时候又滔滔不绝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.32,0:09:14.88,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}except when you wanted him to shut up,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.94,0:09:17.78,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}但他很聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.94,0:09:17.78,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}but he was smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.55,0:09:24.94,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们搭档的第二周
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.55,0:09:24.94,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah. Second week we were together,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.94,0:09:27.34,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我看到了他住的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.94,0:09:27.34,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I saw where he was living.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.79,0:09:30.57,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}让我对他产生了同情
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.79,0:09:30.57,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Kind of made me feel for the guy.
