Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:46.14,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I'd offer you a seat, but, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.10,0:09:51.15,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}没关系 我...不会待太久的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.10,0:09:51.15,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Don't mention it. I, uh...I can't stay.
