Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.78,0:54:01.83,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们想问问你的侄女玛丽的事
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.78,0:54:01.83,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}we wanted to ask you about your niece, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.29,0:54:06.65,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}“你要让一个家庭承受多少痛苦” 我问主
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.29,0:54:06.65,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}"How much could you put on one family?" I ask the Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.13,0:54:08.67,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们想过下去
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.13,0:54:08.67,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We try to get by.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.86,0:54:12.01,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你认识玛丽的生父吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.86,0:54:12.01,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Did you know Marie's birth father?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.01,0:54:13.10,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}伦恩?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.01,0:54:13.10,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Len?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.69,0:54:15.57,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}她爸爸是伦恩 斯特劳斯
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.69,0:54:15.57,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Len Stroghes was her daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.31,0:54:18.37,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.31,0:54:18.37,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.48,0:54:20.90,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们问是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.48,0:54:20.90,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We're asking because, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.90,0:54:23.63,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们听说玛丽和他远走高飞了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.90,0:54:23.63,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}we had heard that Marie ran off with him
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.63,0:54:27.24,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}并不是...真的失踪
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.63,0:54:27.24,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}and that...she wasn't really missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.70,0:54:31.55,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}是黛比说的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.70,0:54:31.55,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}That's what Debbie said.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.56,0:54:35.73,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}有伦恩的消息吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.56,0:54:35.73,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Oh. Well, uh... anybody heard from Len?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.73,0:54:39.46,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}有人知道他在哪里吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.73,0:54:39.46,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Anybody maybe knows where he's at?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.77,0:54:46.28,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}抱歉 最后一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.77,0:54:46.28,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Uh, sorry. The last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.47,0:54:48.18,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你知道黛比现在在哪里吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.47,0:54:48.18,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Do you know where Debbie is now?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.18,0:54:49.79,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}她嫁给别人了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.18,0:54:49.79,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}She married another man.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.79,0:54:52.73,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不是玛丽还在时的那个人...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.79,0:54:52.73,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Not the one she's with when Marie...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.73,0:54:56.21,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}最近一次听说她的消息是她在拉斯维加斯
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.73,0:54:56.21,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}She was in Vegas, last we heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.71,0:55:21.61,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}玛丽一定很喜欢这里
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.71,0:55:21.61,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Marie must have loved it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.73,0:55:22.85,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.73,0:55:22.85,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.22,0:55:24.72,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这些都是她的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.22,0:55:24.72,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}All this for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.91,0:55:27.02,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}丹尼非常爱她
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.91,0:55:27.02,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Danny loved her so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.63,0:55:29.19,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}虽然我们不是她的法定监护人
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.63,0:55:29.19,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}We weren't her legal guardians,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.19,0:55:31.50,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}但她跟我们在一起的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.19,0:55:31.50,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}but she played here all the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.61,0:55:33.29,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}比跟她妈妈的还多
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.61,0:55:33.29,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}more than her Mama's.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.46,0:55:34.69,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我能看出来原因
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.46,0:55:34.69,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I can see why.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.22,0:55:39.37,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}如果你不介意的话 丹尼得的是什么病
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.22,0:55:39.37,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}What is it Dan has, if you don't mind my asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.03,0:55:43.42,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}他们只说是"脑部的问题"
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.03,0:55:43.42,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}All they ever told us was "a cerebral event."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.91,0:55:45.95,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}类似连续中风
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.91,0:55:45.95,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Series of strokes, like.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.18,0:55:55.29,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}马蒂?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.18,0:55:55.29,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Marty?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.25,0:56:00.08,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}失陪一下
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.25,0:56:00.08,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Excuse me for one sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.20,0:56:13.39,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}屋里地板的右边
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.20,0:56:13.39,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Inside on the floor on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.37,0:56:34.89,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我不知道那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.37,0:56:34.89,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I don't know what that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.89,0:56:38.06,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}从警察第一次来过后我就没去过那里
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.89,0:56:38.06,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I haven't looked in there since the police first came.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.96,0:56:48.60,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你肯定想听最精彩的部分吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.96,0:56:48.60,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Bet you want to hear the hero shot, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.02,0:56:53.29,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我们救出孩子的地方?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.02,0:56:53.29,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}That place we carried the kids out?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.29,0:56:54.92,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}最后会问到的 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.29,0:56:54.92,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Eventually, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.95,0:56:59.66,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}她长什么样...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.95,0:56:59.66,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}So what did she look like...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.86,0:57:02.73,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}查尔斯湖的那个人?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.86,0:57:02.73,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}that one in Lake Charles?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.05,0:57:30.13,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你能 看出
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.05,0:57:30.13,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Can you, uh, tell us
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.13,0:57:32.36,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}任何线索吗? 科尔先生
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.13,0:57:32.36,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}anything about that, Mr. Cohle?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.67,0:57:39.74,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这尸体和95年的那具非常像
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.67,0:57:39.74,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}That looks a lot like the one from '95,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.62,0:57:42.36,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不过 你们早就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.62,0:57:42.36,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}but...well, you knew that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.36,0:57:46.57,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}是的 具体内容和95年的案子一致
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.36,0:57:46.57,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah, there are specifics consistent to the '95 case,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.57,0:57:48.73,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}没有公之于众的细节
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.57,0:57:48.73,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}details that weren't public knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.50,0:57:52.93,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你消失了八年 对吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.50,0:57:52.93,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You were off the grid for 8 years, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.52,0:57:56.19,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}- 2010年又出现在这里  - 我的问题是...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.52,0:57:56.19,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}- Show back up here 2010. - My question is...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.19,0:57:58.12,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}怎么会是他...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.19,0:57:58.12,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}How could it be him...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.93,0:58:03.71,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}如果我们95年已经抓到了他?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.93,0:58:03.71,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}if we already caught him in '95?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.38,0:58:08.65,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}确实 怎么会呢 警探们?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.38,0:58:08.65,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}How, indeed, Detectives?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.82,0:58:11.83,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我觉得你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.82,0:58:11.83,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I figured you'd be the one to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.85,0:58:23.70,Chinese,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}那就别他妈问这些没用的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.85,0:58:23.70,English,NTP,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Then start asking the right fuckin' questions.
